Disclaimer

This project uses a synthetic health dataset created for the purpose of methodological demonstration. The data do not represent real individuals, healthcare providers, or institutions, and no real patient information is included.

The objective of the project is to demonstrate applied skills in health economics, econometric analysis, causal reasoning, and machine learning, rather than to produce substantive empirical claims about real-world healthcare systems.

All results should therefore be interpreted as illustrative, and any policy discussions are hypothetical and intended solely to demonstrate analytical reasoning.
